  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "EBBEB77C4A16B48B",
      "text": "Mal sehen... Ja, hier sollte ich gut stehen.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "EBBEB87C4A16B63E",
      "text": "Die Regeln besagen, dass ich mich vorstellen\\nmuss, also... Ich bin Tara von den Top Vier.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "EBBEB97C4A16B7F1",
      "text": "Es ist so ungewöhnlich, von jemandem\\nherausgefordert zu werden, der auf eine\\r\\nandere Akademie geht...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "EBBEBA7C4A16B9A4",
      "text": "Ehrlich gesagt bin ich immer noch ein bisschen\\nperplex deswegen, aber ich werde meine Gefühle\\r\\nnicht unseren Kampf beeinflussen lassen![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "EBBEBB7C4A16BB57",
      "text": "Okay, mal sehen... Du solltest wissen, dass ich\\nvorwiegend Pokémon vom Typ Fee einsetzen\\r\\nwerde.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "EBBEBC7C4A16BD0A",
      "text": "Feen-Pokémon sind so... Hach! So rosa und\\nbezaubernd, einfach umwerfend süß...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "EBBEBD7C4A16BEBD",
      "text": "Harte und ätzende Sachen passen gar nicht\\nzu ihnen. Kein Wunder also, dass die Typen\\r\\nGift und Stahl ihre großen Schwächen sind.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "EBBEAE7C4A16A540",
      "text": "Oh, tut mir leid! So jemand wie du weiß das\\nsicher alles schon längst.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "EBBEAF7C4A16A6F3",
      "text": "Jedenfalls sollte dir klar sein, dass ich mich nicht\\nzurückhalten werde.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "EBC23C7C4A19CC61",
      "text": "Was auch immer passiert, eine Lektion wirst du\\nauf jeden Fall aus diesem Kampf mitnehmen...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_11",
      "hash64": "EBC23B7C4A19CAAE",
      "text": "In Niedlichkeit verbirgt sich gewaltige Stärke![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_12",
      "hash64": "EBC23A7C4A19C8FB",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_13",
      "hash64": "EBC2397C4A19C748",
      "text": "Hast du gesehen, wie meine Pokémon\\ngekämpft haben?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_14",
      "hash64": "EBC2407C4A19D32D",
      "text": "Waren sie nicht zum Knuddeln süß?!\\nDer Gipfel aller Niedlichkeit!![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_01",
      "hash64": "D00BCFCD2F27B3F8",
      "text": "Sie waren total süß!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_02",
      "hash64": "D00BD2CD2F27B911",
      "text": "Ich fand sie eher cool!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_select_03",
      "hash64": "D00BD1CD2F27B75E",
      "text": "Du warst auch süß!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "EBC23F7C4A19D17A",
      "text": "Hehe... Ja, oder? Und als ihre Trainerin hab ich\\ndas Glück, ganz nah an der niedlichen Action\\r\\ndabei zu sein![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_16",
      "hash64": "EBC23E7C4A19CFC7",
      "text": "Dö, dööö... Falsche Antwort!\\c\\nIch rede hier von NIEDLICHKEIT!\\nMit Coolness hat das gar nichts zu tun, okay?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_17",
      "hash64": "EBC23D7C4A19CE14",
      "text": "Dö, dööö... Falsche Antwort!\\c\\nIch rede hier von meinen POKÉMON!\\nNicht von mir![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_18",
      "hash64": "EBC2347C4A19BEC9",
      "text": "Dein[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0F0C)] Pokémon ware Pokémon waren auch meeeganiedlich![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0F0C"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_19",
      "hash64": "EBC2337C4A19BD16",
      "text": "Hach... Eigentlich müsste es verboten werden,\\ndass zwei Trainer so viel Niedlichkeit für sich\\r\\nallein beanspruchen dürfen...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_20",
      "hash64": "EBC5C27C4A1CE5EA",
      "text": "Komm, halten wir diese geballte Niedlichkeit\\nmit einem Foto für die Ewigkeit fest![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_21",
      "hash64": "EBC5C37C4A1CE79D",
      "text": "Oooh, das Foto strotzt ja nur so vor Putzigkeit!\\nDavon muss ich eine Kopie anfertigen! Oder zwei.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_22",
      "hash64": "EBC5C07C4A1CE284",
      "text": "Hier, nimm das als Zeichen dafür, dass ich deine\\nExpertise in Sachen Niedlichkeit anerkenne.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_23",
      "hash64": "EBC5C17C4A1CE437",
      "text": "Du warst stärker als ich, obwohl ich Ernst\\ngemacht habe...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_fairybb_24",
      "hash64": "EBC5BE7C4A1CDF1E",
      "text": "Wir sind alle schon gespannt, wie weit nach oben\\ndu es an unserer Akademie schaffen wirst![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_c_04_clerk_npc",
      "hash64": "6303353446E64743",
      "text": "Herzlichen Glückwunsch zu deinem Sieg über\\nTara von den Top Vier!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
